    <string name="about_text">Termant %1$s\n\nA real Ubuntu 24.04 userland on your phone, without root. Install software with:\n\n    apt update\n    apt install &lt;package&gt;\n\nTap AI for OpenCode, an AI coding agent that can write and run code for you.\n\nPinch to change text size. Long-press to select and copy.\n\nOpen source (GPLv3). Terminal by Termux, userland by PRoot, system by Ubuntu, agent by OpenCode.</string>
